# 📚 Library Management System (C)

A **console-based Library Management System** written in C to manage books, users, and borrowing records.

This project demonstrates structured programming, file handling, and real-world system logic.

---

## 🎯 Features

- Add new books
- Display available books
- Issue and return books
- Search books by ID or name
- Persistent storage using files
- Menu-driven interface

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- C Programming Language
- File Handling (`fopen`, `fread`, `fwrite`)
- Structured programming
- Command-line interface

